From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Auto <auto@local>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] HACK: ASoC: qcom: qdsp6: q6afe: ignore clock set_param errors

On xiaomi-pipa the ADSP often returns status 0x16 for AFE_SVC_CMD_SET_PARAM
(clock enable) right after the similarly-spurious LPASS core HW vote error.
That makes va_macro probe fail with -22, which blocks rx/tx macros,
SoundWire, WCD, and the sm8250 sound card.

Mirror the existing vote HACK: clear the error so clk_prepare_enable can
succeed and the rest of the audio graph can bind.

Also silence unknown-cmd spam for DEVOTE_REQUEST (0x100f6), which the
firmware rejects the same way.
---
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c
@@ -1002,10 +1002,20 @@ static int q6afe_callback(struct apr_device *adev, const struct apr_resp_pkt *da
 			port = q6afe_find_port(afe, hdr->token);
 			if (port) {
 				port->result = *res;
+				if (port->result.status) {
+					dev_err(afe->dev,
+						"HACK(xiaomi-pipa): Ignoring AFE set_param error\n");
+					port->result.status = 0;
+				}
 				wake_up(&port->wait);
 				kref_put(&port->refcount, q6afe_port_free);
 			} else if (hdr->token == AFE_CLK_TOKEN) {
 				afe->result = *res;
+				if (afe->result.status) {
+					dev_err(afe->dev,
+						"HACK(xiaomi-pipa): Ignoring AFE clock set_param error\n");
+					afe->result.status = 0;
+				}
 				wake_up(&afe->wait);
 			}
 			break;
@@ -1015,6 +1025,8 @@ static int q6afe_callback(struct apr_device *adev, const struct apr_resp_pkt *da
 			afe->result.status = 0;
 			wake_up(&afe->wait);
 			break;
+		case AFE_CMD_REMOTE_LPASS_CORE_HW_DEVOTE_REQUEST:
+			break;
 		default:
 			dev_err(afe->dev, "Unknown cmd 0x%x\n",	res->opcode);
 			break;
